# Research material that is NOT ours to publish.
#
# content/wyandanch/ held ~86,600 words scraped from wyandanchlibrary.com. That site states no
# licence anywhere - "open source finance education" is a tagline, not a grant - so the default
# is all rights reserved. Keeping it in a PRIVATE repo was research. Shipping it in a PUBLIC one
# would be redistribution, which is a different thing entirely.
#
# Nothing in src/ reads it. The Vault runs entirely off src/js/vault-index.js, which is our own
# catalogue, our own orientation notes, and outbound links to the source.
content/

# Screenshots and crops produced by tools/shot.mjs during verification.
shot_*.png
crop_*.png
*.tmp
